### Variables
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/applications

### Create
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Backend Developer",
  "company": "Acme",
  "position": "Mid",
  "status": "APPLIED",
  "appliedDate": "2026-11-20",
  "location": "Sofia",
  "workMode": "HYBRID",
  "salaryMin": 3000,
  "salaryMax": 4500,
  "salaryCurrency": "EUR",
  "jobUrl": "https://acme.example/jobs/1",
  "notes": "Referral from a former colleague"
}

### List (filters + paging + sorting are all optional)
GET {{base}}?status=APPLIED&status=INTERVIEWING&q=backend&page=0&size=20&sort=appliedDate,desc

### Get one
GET {{base}}/{{id}}

### Full update (status may be omitted to keep the current one)
PUT {{base}}/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Senior Backend Developer",
  "company": "Acme",
  "appliedDate": "2026-11-20"
}

### Change status only
PATCH {{base}}/{{id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "INTERVIEWING" }

### Dashboard stats
GET {{base}}/stats

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/{{id}}
